    <changeSet id="openworkflow-100-definition-plane-sequences" author="forwardmeasure">
        <comment>incrementBy matches the allocationSize on each entity's @SequenceGenerator, so the
            DB sequence and Hibernate's pooled-lo optimizer agree from the start - no later
            conversion step needed.</comment>
